  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s rights and gender justice upheld by movement for feminist peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s rights and gender justice are upheld by preserving and growing the movement for feminist peace. 
Outcomes:
-	Feminist spaces and agendas are sustained and developed in MENA
-	Women&#x2019;s meaningful participation in decision-making and peacebuilding processes is strengthened in MENA
-	Root causes of conflict are addressed and member states and multilateral actors are held to account in MENA
-	Enhanced implementation of WPS agenda through empowered women, engendered political spaces and.</narrative>
  </description>
